# Stack: after fal.ai's identity (2026). An olive desk with puter's lockup in
# its middle (a big pixel bug), a floating mint bar, white windows under
# mint tabs, no outlines anywhere: things part by colour alone, at a 4px
# corner. Strong flat colours, each app its own, shown as a dot on its tab.
# Set in Geist.
# Roles on the left, the palette's colours on the right. `theme/make` writes
# every app's colours from the palette named in theme/palette.

# The interface.
desk          olive
desk-dot      olive           # no grid
# The big bug in the desk's middle (Desk.qml).
mark          mint
# The dinosaurs standing on the bar (Desk.qml).
dino-1        lilac
dino-2        lime
# The screensaver's life (Life.qml): four colours of cell on the desk.
life-1        lime
life-2        cyan
life-3        pink
life-4        lilac
bar           mint            # the floating bar's pills and the clock
bar-ink       ink
bar-edge      mint            # no line along the bar
search        cyan            # the search mark's tile
search-ink    ink
tab           mint            # a window's tab on the bar
tab-ink       ink
tab-active    paper           # the focused window's tab
tab-active-ink  ink
paper         paper
ink           ink
accent        cyan            # highlights and selections
accent-ink    ink
muted         mint            # headers, the bar's other tabs
muted-ink     stone
outline       mint            # no outlines: where an edge must be drawn, it's the faintest fill
rule          mint-dark       # the lines inside: table grids, dividers
title         mint            # title tabs, and the open tab inside apps
title-ink     ink
title-active  paper           # the focused window's tab: it joins its body

# What's under the pointer inside apps: buttons, tabs, the scroll bar.
hover         mint-dark
hover-ink     ink

# The bar's buttons and tabs, and the window buttons, under the pointer.
button-hover      lime
button-hover-ink  ink
close-hover       pink
close-hover-ink   ink
# An agent's taskbar tab while it waits for you (bin/puter-agent).
attention         pink
attention-ink     ink

